    > "A clipboard, a rota and a list for everything. Order of Tusca? The deck that makes rules? Hatusbal and no shuffling?" @hint Test a guess
      [teobalt] "Three things." Brightly. "One: yes. Two: *yes*. Three: I can't believe you guessed it."
