    [ashton] "I over-leaked. I always over-leak. It's a vice."
    [rowan] "You Pyroblasted three targets on turn two and your hand shrank to four cards. Then I could just wait."
    [ashton] "A sound plan. Waiting for me to run out of hand." He smiles ruefully. "It's the one thing I can't afford, old thing. A patient opponent."
    [rowan] "Then I'll be patient."
  @else
    Ashton sweeps the last cards together with a flourish.
    [ashton] "I do hope the lady was watching."
    [rowan] "You Pyroblasted everything I put down and then laundered the tokens through the Piranhas. I didn't have an answer."
