@scene post_magnus
  @if won:ferry_magnus
    Magnus is staring at the tablet. He has already started a note.
    [magnus] "One-Two-Punch cannot kill on the first turn. You knew that. You used the first turn to set up a Storm that kills before the second."
    [rowan] "It kills on the third. I wasn't racing you. I was making you commit."
    [magnus] "Commit." A thin, careful smile that looks almost real. "I committed. And you did not."
    [rowan] "I don't think the deck you run is the point. The point is what you do when the list stops working."
    [magnus] "That is not a comfortable sentence."
  @else
