    [magnus] "Casual, ferry, unofficial. It did not count." But there is a look in his face that is not quite a smile. "Your Storm was well timed."
    [rowan] "You hit me three times a turn. I had one turn to answer."
    [magnus] "And yet you did not hurry." He looks up. "I would very much like to understand how you do that."
    [rowan] "Honestly? I don't know."
